WEBVTT

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.740
<i>I have no intention to work with others.</i>

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.900
<i>I don’t need any friends.</i>

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.650
<i>Girls like you are annoying!</i>

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.700
That’s the face of a person who’s been shocked, right?

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.820
She was told “you are annoying!”

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.550
She looks extremely blue.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.310
Hey Minto, it’s tea time!

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.640
Hm?

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:46.230
Okay…

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:53.110
Minto-oneechan!
That’s not a cup! It’s a…

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.700
It’s a vase.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.660
She’s seriously ill.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.120
What do you want to talk about?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.660
Well…

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:10.700
What’s the matter?

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.830
Is she really part of the team?

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.230
You mean Fujiwara Zakuro? She transformed, right?

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:20.760
Don’t play dumb! You told us to go find out, but you two already knew, right?

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:26.350
If not you wouldn’t know if danger was approaching the fifth member.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.480
Don’t know…

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.650
Ichigo-oneechan’s really mad now.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.180
Hey! She said she has no intention of joining.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.890
She said that very clearly!
All five of us gathered…

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.560
…but what are we supposed to do if she said something like that?!

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.940
We’re doing our best in the first place
because you said you need the fifth member!

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.030
And now this? Isn’t that a little harsh?

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:50.540
Because of that, Minto’s in shock and she’s acting like a ghost!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.130
What are you mad about?

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.710
WHAT THE HECK?!

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.670
It’s her choice to decide whether to become a member or not.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.710
Your job is to convince her.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.840
And when was that decided?!

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:09.700
Now.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:15.450
I got it. Zakuro-oneechan must be a bad guy.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.180
No way. I don’t think that’s…

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.370
If she’s not a member,
she’s an enemy!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:23.820
Well, that might be right.

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.240
I’ll go see Zakuro-san.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.420
I’ll be irritated if I don’t.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.530
Be careful, she might be an enemy.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.130
That’s not possible!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.130
She denied that possibility strongly.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.350
She’s that kind of girl.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.690
That’s why… she’s perfect
for the Mew Project.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.300
Forgive me.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.140
I will produce results next time.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:57.100
And?

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.470
They should make contact
with that girl again.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:04.280
I will use that opportunity… and erase them from this world.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.310
However,

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:10.530
I believe that Momomiya Ichigo’s ability will come in handy in the future.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.290
So I would like to bring her to our side.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.630
What about the rest?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.220
I will erase them, of course.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.970
We could’ve used this method instead of going to an audition.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.110
We can make contact at a handshake session for sure!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.850
Rea-Really…

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.440
Wee! Handshake!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.040
If there’s this many people…

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.270
What are you talking about?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.910
I’m not going to just sit and wait after what she said.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.130
But, we won’t have time to talk…

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.000
Thank you.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.670
Hello.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.670
I have something important
to talk about.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.170
Sorry, can you just limit it
to a handshake?

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:11.030
What? But I have something to talk about…

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.950
It’ll choke the line behind you.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.560
But I have something to talk about!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.590
Those kind of things are…

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.010
Hey, wait!

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.720
Let go of me!

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.460
Put me down…

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.900
Just as I thought…

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:32.900
This isn’t going to work.
Let’s think of another way.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.780
This one will work.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.830
Ichigo-oneechan! She’s here!

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.390
Where?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.300
Let’s go!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.840
What!?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.050
HELP!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.850
Nice!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.510
Okay, good job!

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:57.310
Good job!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.390
Good job!

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:06.110
Next, we have a live TV broadcast next so wait in the waiting room.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.820
So we have to get her
when she’s alone.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.540
I won’t be satisfied
until I talk to her.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:21.710
As I thought Zakuro-oneechan is truly an enemy.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.450
That’s not true.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.000
If we talk, she will…

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.680
How can you say that?

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.460
Did you see?.. her eyes…

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:36.350
…are similar to yours
when we first met.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:42.780
That’s the reason, I don’t think she’s a bad person.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.520
Ichigo-san.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.730
Okay, let’s go everyone!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.040
You seem quite tired.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.040
I’m going to call for someone.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.880
I don’t mind. Why don’t you call for your friends instead?

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.550
I have no intention to work
with another.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:20.970
I know.

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:26.510
If you work with me,
you can revenge on them.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:27.610
Revenge?

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.430
Is it here?

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.100
She should be taking pictures here.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.770
How did you find out?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.450
We’re going to get scolded at again.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.910
Nobody’s here!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.740
How lucky! Let’s split up
and look for her!

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:41.580
Okay.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.320
Yes.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:49.170
Because, they made your body
into what it is now.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:53.320
Don’t you think of returning back to normal?

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:57.560
If you wish so, I can return it back to normal.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.020
Oneesama! Where are you?

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.440
Why?..

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.410
Oh no…

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:16.040
Tell me you’re lying…
Zakuro-oneesama!

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.490
Gotcha!

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:23.420
Everyone!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.230
Oneesama!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.380
What is this?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.840
This is your punishment
for being late!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.540
No way…

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.920
Minto!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:39.970
Retasu!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.130
Bu-Ling!

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.090
Quiche, what did you?..

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.720
I had those three disappear.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.600
They won’t come back forever depending on the situation.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.530
Give everyone back!

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.990
Then how about this.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.160
The two of you fight.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.370
What are you talking about?

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.490
The winner will have to work with me.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.340
Then I’ll return the three back.
How about it?

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.380
That’s messed up!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.500
Then the three will never return.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.120
Like I said, I don’t work with…

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:21.890
Then you won’t be able
to return back to normal.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.850
Think about it very carefully.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.060
Bye!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.150
Don’t touch it!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.350
This happened because of your fault, Zakuro-san!

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:38.120
If you became a member
in the first place…

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:46.420
This has nothing to do with me.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:09.030
These three lights represent the three.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.110
There’s no need to worry,
they are fine.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.070
I’m glad…

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.290
What’s wrong?

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:21.060
It seems they are trapped inside a different dimension created by the enemy.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.040
So there’s no way to rescue them.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.380
Oh no!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.200
In other words, they’re not going to last very long.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.850
Shirogane, this isn’t the time
to be so calm!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:32.220
We have to do something, quick!

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:36.010
Then do you want to go fight Fujiwara Zakuro right now?

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:37.470
Well...

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.550
If the winner works with him, he will return the three.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:43.010
That’s a lie.

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:44.110
Yes.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:47.980
By taking the three as hostages he shaved off our power

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.380
and is planning on crushing you and Zakuro-san one by one.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:56.240
Then what should I do?
I don’t know anymore!

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:03.590
Do you really believe that
Fujiwara Zakuro is a friend?

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:04.510
What?

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.470
Can you believe in that?

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.730
I see, then go.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.550
Go and tell her your feelings.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.390
Shirogane…

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:18.580
A path might be created if you do so.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:21.150
I see.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:26.660
It might be possible to create a slit in the other dimension with her whip of light.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.190
Ichigo-san.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:32.330
She should be attending a live TV broadcast right now.

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:33.290
Okay!

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.210
This might be a dangerous gamble.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:38.960
Yeah.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:43.080
But the Mew Project won’t succeed if any of them are gone.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:46.930
Unless we risk our lives, we cannot save humanity.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:53.430
I can’t transform no matter
how much I try!

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:56.060
I can’t see anything
without my glasses.

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:58.220
It might be better
if you don’t see anything.

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.990
This place is… somewhat creepy.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.520
Oh? Are you authorized to enter here?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.370
Um… how should I say this…

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.160
You shouldn’t get in without permission.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.380
She’s fine.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.540
Zakuro-san.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.830
Alright.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:18.990
Bye.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.130
Do you have something
to talk about?

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.670
Time is running out.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:27.760
Shirogane said that we might be able to
rescue the three with your amazing powers.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.810
Shirogane?

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:33.720
So, those two bathed you
with a weird light too?

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:34.330
Eh?

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:41.150
I have no intention of helping out selfish people like them for whatever reason.

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.340
Please!

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:46.660
They’re… they’re my important friends.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.080
We can’t even have one person missing!

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:50.480
You…

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.440
…didn’t come here to fight with me?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.650
No.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.630
Zakuro-san, it’s time!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:12.680
It’s time for Ani Ani Animal. I am the chairman, Hitoshi Kusai and…

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.940
I am the assistant, Yoshida Mia.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.840
And the guest is this person.

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:20.340
Good evening, I am Fujiwara Zakuro.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.000
Zakuro-san looks nice with a smile.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.760
Do you have some sort of episode dealing with animals?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:29.320
Yes, I love animals since I was a child.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:32.070
I have had two dogs and three cats.

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.570
She’s really appealing her good side.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.330
You won’t be able to survive in this business unless you’re like that.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.690
Yes, okay.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.250
Let’s go to the first corner.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.160
{WUuaahhh!
}I hate this!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.180
The flowers are disappearing!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.940
What? What’s happening?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.920
This is no good! The other dimension has started shrinking.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.220
At this rate, the three are going to…

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.040
Ichigo! Alien!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.330
Quiche!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:23.990
What do you want?!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:28.840
It’s troublesome if four other girls like you appear at once.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:31.710
But it’s not hard if I do it one by one.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.910
But I won’t kill you, Ichigo.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.430
You’re my important toy.

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:42.300
There’s no use. You can’t do anything with your normal power.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.110
Now, Fujiwara Zakuro can’t transform.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.720
Kill the girl first!

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.100
No! Zakuro-san!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:58.620
The animal we’re going to have Zakuro Fujowara to touch… is this!

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.900
A snake? What should I do?

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.900
Do you wish to give up, Zakura-chan?

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.010
No, I’m okay.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.700
It feels weird.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.160
Are you really okay with
a snake that big?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.460
I’m surprised that you’re able to withstand…

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.170
What the hell is that?!

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.070
Let go! Let go!

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:31.640
Hey wait!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.600
Zakuro-san!

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:37.230
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:40.000
Go, Garara!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.860
No!

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.490
NOoo!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.830
Zakuro-san… run.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.790
Why?

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.800
You’re… a friend.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.320
Kill her.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:20.810
Zakuro-san?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:25.440
She’s not your friend. She ran away.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:29.570
It doesn’t matter,
since I told her to do so.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.970
You sure are obstinate. You’re going to die for real at this rate.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:40.040
So? Do you want to work with me?
If you do, I can help you.

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.410
No way.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.380
I hate toys that don’t listen to me.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.880
I’m never going to work with you!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.590
StrawberBell!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.760
My powers aren’t gathering…

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.220
Then break!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:03.950
This is the end! Goodbye!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:07.210
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.710
Oneesama!

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:13.410
What? What?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.460
So you came after all!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.510
You’re not a bad guy!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.850
What? Where?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.930
Hurry, grab on.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:43.680
Reborn… Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:47.250
You’re really going to die!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.860
I’ll never lose against you…

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.410
Wait, Garara!

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.580
I can’t dodge it…

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.730
Reborn… Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:08.310
What?!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.320
She cut open the other dimension?

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.640
Are you okay, Mew Strawberry?

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:13.860
Everyone…

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.300
It’s our turn now!

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:20.260
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:24.420
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.690
Reborn… PuddingRings INFERNO!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.860
Our powers aren’t working!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:40.960
Please, StrawberBell,
give me the power…

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.630
Mew Strawberry, you can’t do that in your condition…

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.700
It’s coming!

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:48.770
What?

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.010
They’re resonating?

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:55.720
They are…

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.820
I can feel it.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.850
I can feel everyone’s power!

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:35.550
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.410
What incredible power.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:55.040
This is amazing. I can’t break them quite yet.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:56.910
We did it!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:58.040
What happened?

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.490
What about the broadcast?

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.350
Thank you. Um, we’re…

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.590
I…

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:05.100
…don’t like friends.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.520
But…

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:11.120
I’ll consider about it in this case.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.680
Yeah!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:16.940
It’s great!

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.680
We will resume the broadcast.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:27.390
I don’t know what happened, but five super ladies have appeared here.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.790
Is this?… Could it be?..

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:34.630
Is this being broadcasted live throughout the country? ~nya!?

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:43.960
Err… yea, well, we’re from
Tokyo’s cafe Mew…

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:44.950
IDIOT!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.590
Don’t say the truth!

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:48.550
Oh yeah…

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:50.050
Mew Tokyo?

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:52.000
Is that what you all are called?

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.590
You said cafe Mew, right?

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.930
So? Please tell us.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.340
Are you cosplaying?

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.470
Fine!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.270
We five are…

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.310
The protectors of justice,
Tokyo Mew Mew!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.290
And we’ll serve for the future of the Earth! ~Nya!

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.790
That’s very like them.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.050
That idiot!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.650
It’s nice that all five members have gathered

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.210
after Zakuro-san joining but we were broadcasted live through the country.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:31.580
I put a cool name like Tokyo Mew Mew,
well I put the name.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.960
I even gather attention at school

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.340
since TV and magazines say we are cute and wonderful…

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.970
Will we become idols like this?

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:39.180
We will release CDs and everyone will want us in movies and TV shows…

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:41.430
…Our handshake and autograph meets will have a million people!

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.710
Hey, Ichigo, you’re being annoying.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.060
Next time: Identity Revealed,
An Out of Season Cherry Tree Falls Away

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.640
What? Cherry tree falls away?

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.570
What do you mean by fall away?
